# 中文说明：52原子 Ag/Ti3SiC2 开发界面冷态筛查；不施加热源。
units metal
atom_style atomic
boundary p p f
read_data interface_dev_52.data
Reading data file ...
  triclinic box = (0 0 0) to (6.115 5.2957453 34.005876) with tilt (-3.0575 0 0)
WARNING: Triclinic box skew is large. LAMMPS will run inefficiently. (src/domain.cpp:214)
  1 by 1 by 4 MPI processor grid
  reading atoms ...
  52 atoms
  read_data CPU = 0.006 seconds
pair_style pace
ACE version: 2025.12.4p1
Recursive evaluator is used
pair_coeff * * ACE_6A_B1616_E10000_F1_a0.001.yace Ag C Si Ti
Loading ACE_6A_B1616_E10000_F1_a0.001.yace
Total number of basis functions
	Ag: 32 (r=1) 372 (r>1)
	C: 32 (r=1) 372 (r>1)
	Si: 32 (r=1) 372 (r>1)
	Ti: 32 (r=1) 372 (r>1)
Mapping LAMMPS atom type #1(Ag) -> ACE species type #0
Mapping LAMMPS atom type #2(C) -> ACE species type #1
Mapping LAMMPS atom type #3(Si) -> ACE species type #2
Mapping LAMMPS atom type #4(Ti) -> ACE species type #3
neighbor 2.0 bin
neigh_modify delay 0 every 1 check yes

# 记录初始力，用于检查异常大力和原子映射。
variable fnorm atom sqrt(fx*fx+fy*fy+fz*fz)
compute fmax all reduce max v_fnorm
thermo 1
thermo_style custom step atoms temp pe ke etotal c_fmax
thermo_modify flush yes
thermo 100
dump d0 all custom 1 initial_forces.dump id type fx fy fz
dump_modify d0 sort id format float %.16g
run 0
